        "21b2c3d4e5f60718 task upstream:401 → sandpine/svc-lessons (upstream:401)
├─ fault: HTTP 401: Bad credentials
├─ amend it: rhx radio.task.queue set --key 21b2c3d4e5f60718 --auth as-human (needs a gh login on this host)
└─ or drop it: rhx radio.task.queue del --key 21b2c3d4e5f60718 --why "<why>"",
